{"nodes": [{"id": "subscription_implementasi_plan_document", "label": "Subscription and Wallet Implementation Plan", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "subscription-implementasi-plan.md", "source_location": "# Bagdja Website Builder - Subscription & Wallet Implementation Plan", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "subscription_implementasi_plan_subscription_wallet_architecture", "label": "Three-Layer Subscription and Wallet Architecture", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "subscription-implementasi-plan.md", "source_location": "## 3. Arsitektur 3-Layer & Auth Flow", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The admin frontend acts as a BFF, the Website API owns authenticated user-facing routes, and the payment service remains the core engine for subscriptions, wallets, billing, and recurring charges."}, {"id": "subscription_implementasi_plan_per_user_ownership", "label": "Per-User Wallet and Subscription Ownership", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "subscription-implementasi-plan.md", "source_location": "## 4. Model Ownership: PER-USER (Personal, bukan per-Website)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One user owns one IDR wallet and one active subscription across all their websites; this keeps MVP billing simple and follows the proven POS pattern while leaving room for later per-website scope."}, {"id": "subscription_implementasi_plan_jwt_user_resolution", "label": "JWT-Derived User Identity", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "subscription-implementasi-plan.md", "source_location": "### User Resolution Pattern (KRITIS):", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Mutating and querying wallet/subscription routes must derive userId from the authenticated JWT via @CurrentUser(), never from client-supplied body or parameters."}, {"id": "subscription_implementasi_plan_pos_blueprint_adoption", "label": "POS Production Blueprint Adoption", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "subscription-implementasi-plan.md", "source_location": "## 2. Blueprint Pola yang Diadopsi (dari POS)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The POS implementation is adopted because its ownership assertions, error handling, logging, and data model are production-tested, and payment-service endpoints follow that contract."}, {"id": "subscription_implementasi_plan_ownership_assertion", "label": "Subscription Ownership Assertion", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "subscription-implementasi-plan.md", "source_location": "### 5.4 Task 1.3: Buat Modul Subscriptions (Proxy ke Payment-Service)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Checking a requested subscription ID against the authenticated user\u2019s own subscription list and returning 404 prevents cross-user IDOR access without revealing whether another user\u2019s ID exists."}, {"id": "subscription_implementasi_plan_local_cache_plan_limits", "label": "Local Subscription Cache for Plan-Limit Enforcement", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "subscription-implementasi-plan.md", "source_location": "### 5.2 Task 1.1: Buat Entity TypeORM untuk Table Subscription", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Local TypeORM entities cache authoritative payment-service subscription data so plan limits can be enforced without a network call; payment-service remains the source of truth."}, {"id": "subscription_implementasi_plan_plan_limit_enforcement", "label": "Plan Limit Enforcement", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "subscription-implementasi-plan.md", "source_location": "## 7. Fase 3: Plan Limit Enforcement", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "subscription_implementasi_plan_free_plan_defaults", "label": "Default Free Plan Limits", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "subscription-implementasi-plan.md", "source_location": "### 7.3 Task 3.3: Free Plan Metadata Default", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Users without a subscription receive conservative FREE defaults, preventing unmetered resource creation before subscription."}, {"id": "subscription_implementasi_plan_auto_subscribe_free", "label": "Idempotent Auto-Subscribe Free Plan", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "subscription-implementasi-plan.md", "source_location": "### 4.3 Task 4.3: Auto-subscribe Free saat Login", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Automatically provisioning the free tier after OAuth improves onboarding; failures are logged but do not block login, and the operation is idempotent and feature-flagged."}, {"id": "subscription_implementasi_plan_wallet_module", "label": "Wallet Module", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "subscription-implementasi-plan.md", "source_location": "### 5.3 Task 1.2: Buat Modul Wallet (Proxy ke Payment-Service)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "subscription_implementasi_plan_subscriptions_module", "label": "Subscriptions Module", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "subscription-implementasi-plan.md", "source_location": "### 5.4 Task 1.3: Buat Modul Subscriptions (Proxy ke Payment-Service)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "subscription_implementasi_plan_admin_billing_ui", "label": "Admin Billing Dashboard", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "subscription-implementasi-plan.md", "source_location": "## 6. Fase 2: Frontend Admin (bagdja-website-admin)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "subscription_implementasi_plan_public_renderer_paywall", "label": "Public Website Subscription Paywall", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "subscription-implementasi-plan.md", "source_location": "## 9. Fase 5: Public Website Renderer Paywall", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "An inactive paid subscription should make the public renderer show an inactive-site notice rather than serve the normal website; payment-service lookup failures are treated defensively as active to avoid taking down a site."}, {"id": "subscription_implementasi_plan_fase_1_backend_setup", "label": "Phase 1: Backend Setup", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "subscription-implementasi-plan.md", "source_location": "## 5. Fase 1: Backend Setup (bagdja-website-api)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "subscription_implementasi_plan_fase_2_frontend_admin", "label": "Phase 2: Frontend Admin", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "subscription-implementasi-plan.md", "source_location": "## 6. Fase 2: Frontend Admin (bagdja-website-admin)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "subscription_implementasi_plan_fase_3_plan_limit_enforcement", "label": "Phase 3: Plan Limit Enforcement", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "subscription-implementasi-plan.md", "source_location": "## 7. Fase 3: Plan Limit Enforcement", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "subscription_implementasi_plan_fase_4_ux_polish", "label": "Phase 4: UX Polish", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "subscription-implementasi-plan.md", "source_location": "## 8. Fase 4: History, Cancel, Change Plan UX Polish", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "subscription_implementasi_plan_fase_5_public_paywall", "label": "Phase 5: Public Renderer Paywall", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "subscription-implementasi-plan.md", "source_